^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ two-arg-pack SFINAE constructor selected: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] line \d+ WRONG must FAIL: FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
